{% comment %}
  The Well Build — Spec Book intake link for the Shopify ORDER CONFIRMATION email.

  WHERE TO PASTE
    Shopify admin → Settings → Notifications → Customer notifications → Order confirmation → Edit code.
    Paste this whole block just ABOVE the line that starts the order summary
    (search the template for "Order summary"). Save.

  WHAT IT DOES
    Shows a "Start your intake" block only when the order includes the Spec Book
    (product handle healthy-home-spec-book). Other orders look exactly as they do today.
    The link carries only the order number (no name or email in the URL).

  HOW TO TEST
    After saving, click "Send test notification" at the top of the template editor.
    The sample order Shopify uses won't contain the Spec Book, so to see the block, temporarily
    change  == 'healthy-home-spec-book'  to  != ''  , send the test, then change it back.
    Then place a real test order (Bogus Gateway or a 100% discount code) to confirm end to end.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign twb_has_spec_book = false %}
{% for line in line_items %}
  {% if line.product.handle == 'healthy-home-spec-book' %}
    {% assign twb_has_spec_book = true %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if twb_has_spec_book %}
  {% capture twb_intake_url %}https://specbook.thewellbuild.com/?order={{ order_name | remove: '#' | url_encode }}{% endcapture %}
  <table class="row" style="width:100%;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse;margin:24px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td style="background:#F1F6F2;border:1px solid #C5D8CC;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 22px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2A2A2A;">
        <div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B07D4A;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:6px;">Next step</div>
        <div style="font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:22px;color:#1E4430;margin-bottom:8px;">Tell us about your project</div>
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;">
          Your Spec Book starts with a short questionnaire (about 10 minutes) and a link to your drawings.
          Your review begins once we have both, and typically arrives 7–10 business days after that.
        </p>
        <a href="{{ twb_intake_url }}" style="display:inline-block;background:#1E4430;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;">Start your intake &rarr;</a>
        <p style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#6B6B6B;">
          If the button doesn't work, go to <a href="{{ twb_intake_url }}" style="color:#1E4430;">specbook.thewellbuild.com</a>.
        </p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
{% endif %}
